    <string name="model_mgr_hint">Amaphekethe amabili okuhumusha phakathi kweSiTshayina neSisiNgesi asevele afakwe. Ukukhetha “Ngokuzenzekelayo” = uhlelo luzobona ulimi lusebenzayo luhumushe ngokuzenzekelayo; ukukhetha ngesandla iphakethe lolimi elifakiwe = lelo phakethe lizokhethwa kuqala ekuhumusheni. Ukukhetha iphakethe lolimi elifakwe kungakabi khona kuzovula ukulanda ngokuzenzekelayo (cishe i-30–60MB ngalinye; ezinye amaphakethe zidinga inethiwekhi yangaphandle ukuze zilandwe), futhi ngemva kokulanda ungakukhetha</string>
