    <string name="main_desc">Ngemuva kokukopisha noma ukukhetha umbhalo (kunoma yiluphi uhlelo lokusebenza), uzovela inkinobho yephutha elibhangqa &quot;Ukuhumusha&quot; engxenyeni yephezulu yokunene wesikrini; thepha yona uzohumusha futhi imphumela ivelele kwi-popup.\n\nIzinyathelo ezidingekayo:\n1. Nikeza imvume &quot;Veza phezu kwezinye izinhlelo&quot; (iwindow ephumayo);\n2. Vula insizakusebenza yokufinyelela yale nhlelo (indlela eyodwa yokufunda isikhombimsebenzisi ngemuva ku-Android 10+);\n3. Vumela uhlelo lokusebenza luqalise ngokuzenzakalela futhi uvalise ukuthuthukiswa kwebhethri, ukuze insizakusebenza ingavalwa.</string>
